
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Personal Portfolio</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background: #f4f6f9;
            color: #333;
        }

        header {
            background: #243b55;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        nav {
            background: #141e30;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 12px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 12px;
        }

        section {
            background: white;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            max-width: 800px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #243b55;
        }

        button {
            background: #243b55;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        a {
            color: #1769aa;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            background: #141e30;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>My Personal Portfolio</h1>
        <p>Student | Web Developer | Learner</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
        <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="#certifications">Certifications</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>Hello! I am a student interested in technology
        and software development. I enjoy learning new skills
        and developing useful projects.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="skills">
        <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>HTML and CSS</li>
            <li>JavaScript</li>
            <li>Python</li>
            <li>Git and GitHub</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="projects">
        <h2>Academic Projects</h2>
        <h3>Personal Portfolio Website</h3>
        <p>A website created to display my skills,
        projects, and achievements.</p>

        <h3>Student Management System</h3>
        <p>A project designed to manage student details
        and academic records.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="certifications">
        <h2>Certifications</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Web Development Fundamentals</li>
            <li>Python Programming</li>
            <li>Introduction to Git and GitHub</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Information</h2>
        <p>Email: student@example.com</p>
        <p>GitHub:
            <a href="https://github.com/"
               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
               Visit GitHub
            </a>
        </p>
        <button onclick="showMessage()">Contact Me</button>
        <p id="message"></p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My Personal Portfolio</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function showMessage() {
            document.getElementById("message").textContent =
                "Thank you for visiting my portfolio!";
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
